[[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429086\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428983\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Remove the plug (1a) and, in its place, fit the tool (1b) on\nthe exhaust side camshaft.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Fit the tool positioning it with\nthe references in a horizontal direction and checking that it is correctly\ninserted in the housing in the camshaft.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Template</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.871.000.900</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Fit a suitable (8 mm diameter) pin via the special opening in\nthe gearbox.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Check that the pin is correctly\ninserted in the housing in the engine flywheel.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052784.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the left-threaded bolt (1a) for the pulley flange on the\ncrankshaft using the tools (1b) and (1c) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.871.000.200</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Support for counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the pulley flange on the crankshaft.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052785.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refi the pulley flange to the crankcase (1a) and tighten the\nleft-threaded bolt (1b) to the specified torque using tools (1c)\nand (1d) as countertorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Left hand thread bolt</p></td><td><p>PULLEY SUPPORT FLANGE ON CRANKSHAFT</p></td><td><p>M14</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Crankshaft side) 21.9 ÷ 24.2</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.871.000.200</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Support for counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052786.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<p>Remove the pin from the hole on the gearbox.</p><p>Remove the tool for timing the exhaust\nside camshaft and tighten the plug.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Template</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.871.000.900</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428983\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429086\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]